<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40771" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίρρῠτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιρρέω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>running</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕδατα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>CP</u>
					3.8.3
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>HP</u>
				5.9.5
			</span></i>; of food, <i>infused into</i> the body, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τροφῆς νάματα ἐ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ti.</u>
				80d
			</span></i>; of sight, <i>infused</i> from the sun, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>R.</u>
				508b
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψυχαί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ti.Locr.
					99e
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡδοναὶ δι᾽</span>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰσθήσεων ἐπίρρυτοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Max.
				</span></i>
			 Tyr.<i><span class="en">
				31.7
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. δύναμις</span>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σύμφυτος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				1.319
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>. metaph.,
				<i>overflowing, abundant</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καρπός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Eu.</u>
					907
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>. 
				Pass.
			, <i>flowed into, subject to influx</i>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπόρρυτος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ti.</u>
				43a
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>.
				<i>overflowed, moist</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πεδίον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>An.</u>
					1.2.22
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>. as
				Subst., perh. <i>oilvessel</i> or <i>pipe</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλείψασαν δρακτοῖς καὶ ἐπιρύτοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>JRS</u>
					16.90
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				479.10
			</span></i> note. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιρρῠφέω</span></b> , 
				Ion.
			 for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ρροφέω</span>
		(q.v.).</div>
